00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:11.349
So we did a lot of
work around our end

00:17:11.349 --> 00:17:15.940
to set up reproducible
environments on many projects

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:18.089
which has a learning curve.

00:17:18.089 --> 00:17:23.308
But yeah, we are
making progress, right?

00:17:23.308 --> 00:17:24.089
Great.

00:17:24.089 --> 00:17:27.869
