00:29:39.350 --> 00:29:44.080
And then it's not only
Git, but also package

00:29:44.080 --> 00:29:47.200
dependencies with renv.

00:29:47.200 --> 00:29:49.720
When you start your
project on any project

00:29:49.720 --> 00:29:52.000
not only in Shiny app,
but could a mantle,

00:29:52.000 --> 00:29:54.470
could be even a
book, for instance.

00:29:54.470 --> 00:29:57.880
When I wrote the book, like the
outstanding Shiny [INAUDIBLE]

00:29:57.880 --> 00:30:02.830
book, I first thought
about renv freezing

00:30:02.830 --> 00:30:04.930
